{
  "choices": [
    {
      "finish_reason": "stop",
      "index": 0,
      "message": {
        "content": "{\n  \"status\": \"updated\",\n  \"chapter_updates\": [\n    {\n      \"chapter_id\": \"Ch4\",\n      \"updated_plan\": {\n        \"reader_objective\": \"使读者系统掌握抗生素、质子泵抑制剂、饮食模式及生活方式等外部因素如何通过改变肠道微生物组进而影响ICI疗效，理解暴露时机、药物类别与肿瘤背景对效应的修饰作用，并清晰区分观察性关联与因果推断的边界，为后续主动微生物干预策略（Ch5）奠定临床现实与方法学基础。\",\n        \"thesis\": \"外部因素（抗生素、PPIs、饮食及生活方式）通过重塑肠道微生物组稳态，显著调节实体瘤患者对免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）的临床疗效；其影响具有高度的时间窗口依赖性、药物类别特异性及肿瘤类型异质性。观察性关联证据在多数实体瘤中一致指向负面干扰（如抗生素与PPIs缩短OS/PFS），但因果链条受适应症偏倚与混杂因素制约；特定干预策略（如高纤维饮食、精准益生菌）在部分队列中显示正向潜力，而广谱抗菌或胃酸抑制药物的破坏效应则更为明确。综合判断表明，微生物组的\"可塑性\"与\"脆弱性\"共同决定了外部干预的净临床收益，未来需通过标准化暴露定义与前瞻性设计厘清因果边界。\",\n        \"units\": [\n          {\n            \"unit_id\": \"Ch4_U01\",\n            \"substantive_point\": \"抗生素暴露的时间窗口与疗程长度决定其对ICI疗效的负面影响强度，且存在肿瘤类型特异性；围治疗期（ICI启动前后30–90天）为关键脆弱窗口，但适应症偏倚和感染严重程度构成残余混杂。\",\n            \"ordered_development\": \"首先确立围治疗期（ICI启动前后30–90天）为关键脆弱窗口，对比术前与术后暴露的差异；其次引入剂量-反应关系（疗程>10天风险递增）与类别特异性（氟喹诺酮类风险更高）；随后以HCC等特定癌种的阴性/中性结果作为反例，说明肝硬化基线免疫抑制或特定菌群结构可能缓冲抗生素扰动；最后统一讨论适应症偏倚（感染严重程度与基线体能状态）对效应量估计的潜在高估，避免过度泛化。\",\n            \"paragraph_briefs\": [\n              {\n                \"paragraph_id\": \"Ch4_U01_P01\",\n                \"unit_id\": \"Ch4_U01\",\n                \"point\": \"界定ICI治疗前后30–90天为抗生素暴露的高危窗口，对比术前与术后暴露的生存差异，并引入荟萃分析对[-45,45]天窗口的定量支持。\",\n                \"development\": \"比较P0575大样本队列中术后暴露（HR 1.27）与术前暴露（HR 1.04，多变量调整后不显著）的OS风险，论证微生物完整性在免疫启动期的脆弱性。补充P0081荟萃分析中[-45,45]天窗口内抗生素暴露与OS恶化风险最高的定量数据（β=0.2192, p=0.008），以及P0576综述中ICI启动前30–60天为多数研究一致报告的高风险窗口的汇总证据。\",\n                \"source_handles\": [\"P0575\", \"P0081\", \"P0576\"]\n              },\n              {\n                \"paragraph_id\": \"Ch4_U01_P02\",\n                \"unit_id\": \"Ch4_U01\",\n                \"point\": \"建立抗生素疗程长度与OS下降的剂量-反应关系，提示广谱破坏的累积效应，并讨论药物类别特异性。\",\n                \"development\": \"引用P0061数据展示>10天疗程导致OS骤降（2.8 vs 8.8个月），结合P0576综述中氟喹诺酮类与β-内酰胺类为最常用且对菌群多样性影响最深远的类别描述，说明暴露强度与疗效受损的正相关性。指出多数回顾性研究因统计效能不足未能确立类别间统计学差异，但作用谱（spectrum of activity）而非类别本身可能是关键决定因素。\",\n                \"source_handles\": [\"P0061\", \"P0576\", \"P0402\"]\n              },\n              {\n                \"paragraph_id\": \"Ch4_U01_P03\",\n                \"unit_id\": \"Ch4_U01\",\n                \"point\": \"引入HCC等特定癌种的阴性结果，讨论肝硬化背景下的免疫缓冲效应与结论外推边界；统一处理适应症偏倚对效应量估计的影响。\",\n                \"development\": \"利用P0275 Meta分析指出HCC中抗生素未显著恶化OS（HR 1.41, P=0.088）/PFS/ORR/DCR，结合肝硬化导致的基线免疫抑制与肠肝轴紊乱，解释为何抗生素扰动在此类人群中不转化为明确的生存劣势。同时指出所有观察性证据均受适应症偏倚制约：病情更重或合并感染的患者更可能接受抗生素，导致负面效应可能被高估；P0081的GRADE评级显示多数生存结局证据确定性为低至中等。\",\n                \"source_handles\": [\"P0275\", \"P0081\"]\n              }\n            ],\n            \"cases\": [\n              {\n                \"conditions\": \"UC Health多中心回顾性队列（n=21,108），泛实体瘤接受PD-1/PD-L1/CTLA-4抑制剂\",\n                \"finding\": \"仅术后暴露（+1至+60天）与死亡风险增加27%相关（HR 1.27），而仅术前暴露无显著长期影响（HR 1.04）。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"82ebda249f3476e1948f523a9219bd678f5165c3\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0575\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"conditions\": \"印度Tata纪念医院晚期实体瘤CPI治疗队列（N=155），回顾性审计\",\n                \"finding\": \"抗生素使用时长>10天与显著缩短的中位OS（2.8个月 vs 8.8个月, p=0.025）相关，≤10天组生存期接近未暴露组。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"1802c54fde7426f92c3e5e6d085590592e3f2f66\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0061\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"conditions\": \"肝细胞癌（HCC）Meta分析（6项研究，1056名患者），亚洲人群为主\",\n                \"finding\": \"抗生素使用未显著影响HCC患者的OS（HR 1.41, P=0.088）、PFS、ORR或DCR。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"768ceed11b5509cd8f6c24d07e8fa015646929c0\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0275\"\n              }\n            ],\n            \"supporting_studies\": [\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"提供UC Health多中心大样本队列数据，对比术后暴露（HR 1.27）与术前暴露（HR 1.04）的生存差异，界定ICI启动前后60天为抗生素干扰的高危窗口，论证微生物完整性在免疫启动期的脆弱性。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"82ebda249f3476e1948f523a9219bd678f5165c3\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0575\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"基于印度Tata纪念医院真实世界审计数据，展示>10天疗程导致OS骤降（2.8 vs 8.8个月），建立抗生素暴露强度与疗效受损的正向剂量-反应关系，提示广谱破坏的累积效应。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"1802c54fde7426f92c3e5e6d085590592e3f2f66\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0061\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"引入HCC Meta分析（n=1056亚洲人群）阴性结果，结合肝硬化基线免疫抑制与肠肝轴紊乱背景，解释抗生素扰动在此类人群中不转化为明确生存劣势，警示单一机制模型的外推边界。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"768ceed11b5509cd8f6c24d07e8fa015646929c0\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0275\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"提供69项研究、22,568名患者的系统综述与荟萃分析数据，量化抗生素暴露与OS恶化（HR=1.61）、PFS缩短（HR=1.43）及ORR降低（RR=0.58）的关联，并通过Meta回归确认[-45,45]天窗口为效应异质性的主要解释因素（β=0.2192, p=0.008）。GRADE评级显示多数生存结局证据确定性为低至中等，适应症偏倚为主要局限。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"1d2792ae1850f48accaf1c111b2d92b6b2ebc6c0\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0081\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"系统梳理抗生素暴露与ICI疗效关联的临床证据，明确ICI启动前30–60天为多数研究一致报告的高风险窗口，同期暴露影响较弱或不一致；指出β-内酰胺类和氟喹诺酮类为最常用类别，但类别间统计学差异因统计效能不足而未确立，作用谱广度可能是更关键的决定因素。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"CorpusId:286786239\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0576\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"提供NSCLC队列中抗生素暴露导致PD-L1高表达（≥50%）人群OS显著缩短的实证，揭示宿主生物标志物状态与微生物组干预效应的高度情境依赖性。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"e8fb88935a5c5757dc683f56d1ff0c0f356b20ae\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0517\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"通过系统综述量化多数实体瘤中抗生素暴露导致生存率下降的风险幅度，并指出黑色素瘤中的阴性结果，警示单一机制模型的外推边界。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"f35b573335f00cb26d5316eda7d52df639464dbd\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0547\"\n              }\n            ],\n            \"synthesis\": \"抗生素对ICI疗效的损害并非均质发生，而是高度集中于ICI诱导免疫启动与致敏的关键时间窗（尤其是治疗后早期）。P0575的大样本数据与P0081的荟萃分析共同支持围治疗期（[-45,+60]天）为脆弱窗口。长疗程与特定广谱类别（如氟喹诺酮类）加剧了有益菌群的不可逆耗竭。然而，在HCC等伴随严重肝硬化与固有免疫抑制的癌种中，抗生素的负面信号减弱甚至消失（P0275），提示宿主基础微环境（如门脉高压、肠肝轴功能障碍）可能掩盖或替代了单纯的菌群介导效应。所有证据均为观察性关联，适应症偏倚（感染严重程度、基线体能状态）可能导致效应量被高估；这要求临床评估必须结合肿瘤分期、肝功能状态与感染指征进行分层，而非简单归因于微生物组破坏。\",\n            \"transition\": \"明确了抗生素扰动的时序与情境依赖后，需进一步考察其他广泛使用的支持性药物（如PPIs）是否遵循相似的干扰逻辑，及其是否存在独立的药代动力学或微生物组双重作用路径。\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"unit_id\": \"Ch4_U02\",\n            \"substantive_point\": \"质子泵抑制剂（PPIs）通过降低胃酸促进口腔细菌易位与菌群多样性丧失，独立预测ICI疗效下降，且效应受既往化疗时序的修饰；H2受体阻滞剂未显示同等程度的生存损害，为必须抑酸治疗的患者提供了潜在的降级选择。\",\n            \"ordered_development\": \"首先基于大规模荟萃分析与真实世界数据确立PPIs使用与OS/PFS缩短的统计关联；其次阐述PPI导致\"口腔化\"定植及特定菌群变化的生物学合理性；随后引入化疗近期暴露对PPI效应的掩盖作用，揭示治疗背景对药物干扰效应的复杂修饰；最后对比H2受体阻滞剂（H2B）的相对安全性及药物警戒信号，提供临床替代思路与监测建议。\",\n            \"paragraph_briefs\": [\n              {\n                \"paragraph_id\": \"Ch4_U02_P01\",\n                \"unit_id\": \"Ch4_U02\",\n                \"point\": \"量化PPIs使用与ICI生存结局的负相关，强调使用时窗（基线/ICI前60天）的决定性作用。\",\n                \"development\": \"整合P0339 Meta分析数据（33项研究，OS HR 1.31, PFS HR 1.30），对比不同暴露时窗的效应差异：仅在ICI前60天内或基线使用时效应最强，同期使用后无显著影响，确立PPI作为独立预后不良因子的地位。\",\n                \"source_handles\": [\"P0339\"]\n              },\n              {\n                \"paragraph_id\": \"Ch4_U02_P02\",\n                \"unit_id\": \"Ch4_U02\",\n                \"point\": \"揭示化疗近期暴露对PPI效应的修饰作用，并提出\"口腔化\"易位与菌群多样性丧失的机制假说。\",\n                \"development\": \"结合P0537发现化疗结束至ICI开始间隔<1年可消除PPI负面影响（HR 1.09, p=0.36），以及P0289 SCRUM-Japan队列中PPI使用者粪便口腔细菌比例显著升高且与更差PFS趋势相关的观察，构建\"胃酸抑制→口腔细菌易位→菌群失调→免疫priming受损\"的逻辑链。P0537同时报告PPI使用者乳酸杆菌科和韦荣球菌属相对丰度较高，提示PPI诱导的特定菌群重塑模式。\",\n                \"source_handles\": [\"P0537\", \"P0289\"]\n              },\n              {\n                \"paragraph_id\": \"Ch4_U02_P03\",\n                \"unit_id\": \"Ch4_U02\",\n                \"point\": \"对比PPIs与H2B的毒性信号差异，引用药物警戒数据，并提供临床用药降级与监测建议。\",\n                \"development\": \"引用P0088 FAERS药物警戒分析显示ICI+PPI联用在肝胆疾病（RORadj 7.10）、皮肤及皮下组织疾病（RORadj 1.53）、代谢与营养障碍（RORadj 2.66）方面报告率显著升高，结合P0537中H2B未达显著生存影响的观察，提出在必须抑酸时优先考虑H2B或严格限定PPI适应症的实践启示。P0286的iDDI框架综述将PPI归类为通过微生物群途径影响免疫治疗的代表性药物类别。\",\n                \"source_handles\": [\"P0088\", \"P0537\", \"P0286\"]\n              }\n            ],\n            \"cases\": [\n              {\n                \"conditions\": \"泛实体瘤Meta分析（33项研究，~15,957名OS患者），随机效应模型\",\n                \"finding\": \"PPI使用与较短的OS（HR=1.31, 95% CI 1.19–1.44）和PFS（HR=1.30, 95% CI 1.17–1.46）显著相关；仅在ICI前60天内或基线使用时效应最强，同期使用后无显著影响。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"9225e04c4f9620a87d4eb74932067cab87644bf2\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0339\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"conditions\": \"单中心回顾性队列（n=1078）及前瞻性黑色素瘤（n=42）/NSCLC-RCC小样本（n=8）探索性分析\",\n                \"finding\": \"PPI使用总体与OS缩短相关（HR 1.39），但在化疗结束至ICI开始间隔<1年的患者中该关联消失（HR 1.09, p=0.36）；PPI使用者乳酸杆菌科和韦荣球菌属相对丰度较高。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"ef3aa04c443ab46a0b126661b9aab2a6d8239655\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0537\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"conditions\": \"美国FAERS数据库自发报告系统（2014Q1-2023Q4），非比例性信号检测\",\n                \"finding\": \"ICI+PPI联用报告比值比（RORadj）显著升高：肝胆疾病（7.10）、皮肤及皮下组织疾病（1.53）、代谢与营养障碍（2.66）。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"2129f97a58fe871598a9da0cb18083d6d6fa4729\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0088\"\n              }\n            ],\n            \"supporting_studies\": [\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"整合33项研究Meta分析数据（OS HR=1.31, PFS HR=1.30），量化PPI使用与ICI生存结局的负相关，强调基线或ICI前60天内使用时窗的决定性作用，确立PPI作为独立预后不良因子的地位。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"9225e04c4f9620a87d4eb74932067cab87644bf2\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0339\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"揭示化疗结束至ICI开始间隔<1年可消除PPI负面影响（HR 1.09），并报告PPI使用者乳酸杆菌科和韦荣球菌属相对丰度较高，构建\"胃酸抑制→菌群失调→免疫priming受损\"的逻辑链；同时对比H2B未达显著生存影响。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"ef3aa04c443ab46a0b126661b9aab2a6d8239655\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0537\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"提供FAERS药物警戒数据，量化ICI+PPI联用在肝胆疾病（RORadj 7.10）、皮肤及皮下组织疾病（RORadj 1.53）、代谢与营养障碍（RORadj 2.66）方面的DDI信号，为临床用药降级与监测建议提供实证依据。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"2129f97a58fe871598a9da0cb18083d6d6fa4729\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0088\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"基于SCRUM-Japan大规模队列（n=817化疗初治+n=333 ICI治疗），证实PPI使用者粪便中口腔细菌比例显著升高，且高口腔细菌比例在PPI使用者中与更差PFS趋势相关（中位3.15 vs 2.04个月, P=0.08），阐明PPI通过促进口腔细菌易位重塑肠道生态位。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"7fe882e8b39d1a041fd2fee47d9321c965f01aa5\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0289\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"提出免疫学药物-药物相互作用（iDDI）概念框架，将PPI归类为通过微生物群途径（胃酸抑制→菌群组成改变）影响ICI疗效的代表性药物类别，并讨论了适应症偏倚（'病人用户偏差'）对观察性证据的制约。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"7e82740a20ee584360b9fa976bf4b172c099caa4\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0286\"\n              }\n            ],\n            \"synthesis\": \"PPIs对ICI疗效的负面影响具有明确的流行病学支撑（P0339），其核心机制在于胃酸抑制引发的肠道pH值上升，导致口腔细菌向肠道易位（P0289）及共生菌群组成改变（P0537）。这种\"口腔化\"定植不仅削弱了产SCFAs菌的丰度，还可能通过改变免疫微环境干扰抗肿瘤免疫priming。值得注意的是，近期化疗（<1年）可能通过剧烈的菌群重置与免疫微环境重塑，暂时掩盖或抵消了PPI的细微扰动（P0537），提示治疗史是解读PPI效应的关键修饰变量。此外，PPIs与irAEs（如肝毒性、皮肤反应）报告率的协同升高（P0088）提示其干扰不仅限于抗肿瘤免疫，还波及免疫耐受边界。相比之下，H2B未显示同等程度的生存损害（P0537），为需要抑酸治疗的患者提供了潜在的降级选择。所有证据均为观察性关联，PPI使用者的基线疾病严重程度和合并用药构成残余混杂。\",\n            \"transition\": \"在确认强效药物（抗生素、PPIs）的破坏性后，需转向更具可控性的生活方式与营养干预，评估饮食模式与补充剂能否通过定向重塑菌群实现疗效增益或毒性缓解。\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"unit_id_remap\": {\n    \"Ch4_U01\": [\"Ch4_U01\"],\n    \"Ch4_U02\": [\"Ch4_U02\"]\n  }\n}",
        "reasoning_content": "Let me analyze the current task carefully.\n\nThe task is to revise Ch4_U01 and Ch4_U02 based on the autonomous unit selector's improvement focus. Let me understand what's being asked:\n\n1. The selection reason states: \"抗生素和 PPI 的效应量、时间窗、癌种反例与校正需求同时出现在 Ch1 U2（P0081、P0402、P0585）与 Ch4 U01/U02（P0575、P0061、P0275、P0339、P0537），存在观察性关联修饰变量与外部因素专章之间的职责重叠。\"\n\n2. The improvement focus says:\n- Ch1 U2 仅保留外部药物暴露作为微生物-ICI 关联强度的修饰变量与校正必要性\n- Ch4 U01/U02 承担抗生素与 PPI 的时间窗、剂量、药物类别、肿瘤背景和替代用药比较\n- 统一处理指示偏倚、化疗时序修饰、HCC 阴性结果与残余混杂的条件边界\n\nSince Ch1 U2 is read-only in this task, I only need to modify Ch4_U01 and Ch4_U02.\n\nLet me review the current plans:\n\n**Ch4_U01** (Antibiotics):\n- Current substantive_point: \"抗生素暴露的时间窗口与疗程长度决定其对ICI疗效的负面影响强度，且存在肿瘤类型特异性。\"\n- Cases: P0575 (UC Health cohort, post-only HR 1.27), P0061 (Tata Memorial, >10 days), P0275 (HCC meta-analysis, null)\n- Supporting studies: P0575, P0061, P0275, P0517, P0547\n- Paragraph briefs: 3 paragraphs covering timing, dose-response, HCC counter-example\n\n**Ch4_U02** (PPIs):\n- Current substantive_point: \"质子泵抑制剂（PPIs）通过降低胃酸促进口腔细菌易位与菌群多样性丧失，独立预测ICI疗效下降，且效应受既往化疗时序的修饰。\"\n- Cases: P0339 (meta-analysis, HR 1.31), P0537 (chemo timing modifier), P0286 (FAERS signal)\n- Supporting studies: P0339, P0537, P0286, P0289, P0088\n- Paragraph briefs: 3 paragraphs covering meta-analysis, chemo timing, H2B comparison\n\nNow let me check what materials are available and whether the current plans need improvement:\n\nLooking at the materials:\n- P0575: UC Health retrospective cohort, n=21,108, post-only HR 1.27, pre-only HR 1.04 (NS)\n- P0061: Tata Memorial, n=155, >10 days OS 2.8 vs 8.8 months\n- P0275: HCC meta-analysis, 6 studies, 1056 patients, OS HR 1.41 P=0.088 (NS)\n- P0576: Narrative review summarizing timing evidence (pre-ICI 30-60 days most harmful)\n- P0081: Meta-analysis of drug effects, antibiotic OS HR=1.61, [-45,45] window β=0.2192\n- P0402: Narrative review, timing evidence, pre-ICI 30 days most harmful\n- P0339: PPI meta-analysis, 33 studies, OS HR=1.31, PFS HR=1.30\n- P0537: PPI + chemo timing interaction, chemo <1 year eliminates PPI effect\n- P0286: FAERS pharmacovigilance, ICI+PPI signals\n- P0088: FAERS DDI analysis (same paper as P0286? No, P0286 is the iDDI review, P0088 is the FAERS analysis)\n\nWait, let me re-check. Looking at the source_materials:\n- P0286 (7e82740a...) = \"Immunological Drug–Drug Interactions in Immune Checkpoint Inhibitor Therapy\" - this is a review\n- P0088 (2129f97a...) = \"Adverse reactions of immune checkpoint inhibitors combined with Proton pump inhibitors: a pharmacovigilance analysis\" - this is the FAERS study\n\nIn the current Ch4_U02 plan, the cases list P0286 as the FAERS study, but looking at the actual material, P0286 is the iDDI review paper, not the FAERS paper. The FAERS paper is P0088. Let me check the current plan more carefully...\n\nLooking at Ch4_U02 cases:\n- Case 3 says: \"美国FAERS数据库自发报告系统（2014Q1-2023Q4），非比例性信号检测\" with source_handle P0286\n\nBut looking at P0286's actual content: it's \"Immunological Drug–Drug Interactions in Immune Checkpoint Inhibitor Therapy: Mechanisms, Clinical Evidence, and Artificial Intelligence\" - a review paper, NOT the FAERS study.\n\nThe FAERS study is P0088: \"Adverse reactions of immune checkpoint inhibitors combined with Proton pump inhibitors: a pharmacovigilance analysis of drug-drug interactions\"\n\nSo there's a citation error in the current plan! The FAERS data should be attributed to P0088, not P0286.\n\nLet me also check P0289: \"Microbiome Landscape and Association with Response to Immune Checkpoint Inhibitors in Advanced Solid Tumors: A SCRUM-Japan MONSTAR-SCREEN Study\" - this is about oral bacteria and PPI.\n\nNow, let me assess whether the current plans need substantive changes:\n\nFor Ch4_U01:\n- The current plan is well-structured with timing (P0575), dose-response (P0061), and HCC counter-example (P0275)\n- P0576 and P0402 provide additional timing context (pre-ICI 30-60 days)\n- P0081 provides meta-analytic evidence for the [-45,45] window\n- The plan could be strengthened by incorporating P0576/P0402's discussion of pre-ICI timing being more consistently harmful across studies, and P0081's quantitative window data\n- However, the current plan already captures the key points well\n\nFor Ch4_U02:\n- There's a citation error: P0286 is cited for FAERS data but it's actually a review; the FAERS data is from P0088\n- The plan structure is good but needs this correction\n- P0537's chemo timing modifier is well-handled\n- P0289 (SCRUM-Japan) provides the oral bacteria/PPI mechanism evidence\n\nLet me also check if there are issues with the improvement focus requirements:\n1. \"Ch4 U01/U02 承担抗生素与 PPI 的时间窗、剂量、药物类别、肿瘤背景和替代用药比较\" - The current plans do cover timing, dose, tumor background. Drug class specificity is mentioned but could be strengthened. Alternative medication comparison (H2B vs PPI) is in U02.\n2. \"统一处理指示偏倚、化疗时序修饰、HCC 阴性结果与残余混杂的条件边界\" - HCC is in U01, chemo timing in U02. Indication bias is mentioned but could be more explicit.\n\nLet me now decide what changes to make:\n\nFor Ch4_U01:\n- The plan is largely good. I should:\n  - Add P0576 and P0402 as supporting studies for the timing evidence (they provide the broader context of pre-ICI 30-60 days being the critical window)\n  - Add P0081 for the quantitative [-45,45] window data\n  - Strengthen the indication bias discussion\n  - Keep the HCC counter-example\n  - The paragraph structure is good, maybe add a brief mention of indication bias in the synthesis\n\nFor Ch4_U02:\n- Fix the citation error: FAERS data should be P0088, not P0286\n- P0286 can remain as a supporting study for the iDDI framework\n- Keep the chemo timing modifier from P0537\n- Keep P0289 for the oral bacteria mechanism\n- The H2B comparison is good\n\nActually, wait. Let me re-read the current Ch4_U02 more carefully. The cases section lists:\n- Case 3: \"美国FAERS数据库自发报告系统（2014Q1-2023Q4），非比例性信号检测\" with paper_id \"7e82740a20ee584360b9fa976bf4b172c099caa4\" and source_handle \"P0286\"\n\nBut P0286's paper_id is \"7e82740a20ee584360b9fa976bf4b172c099caa4\" and its title is \"Immunological Drug–Drug Interactions in Immune Checkpoint Inhibitor Therapy: Mechanisms, Clinical Evidence, and Artificial Intelligence\". This is NOT the FAERS study.\n\nThe FAERS study is P0088 with paper_id \"2129f97a58fe871598a9da0cb18083d6d6fa4729\" and title \"Adverse reactions of immune checkpoint inhibitors combined with Proton pump inhibitors: a pharmacovigilance analysis of drug-drug interactions\".\n\nSo the current plan has P0286 incorrectly attributed with FAERS findings. The FAERS findings (RORadj for hepatobiliary 7.10, skin 1.53, metabolic 2.66) actually come from P0088.\n\nWait, but looking at the P0286 material more carefully in the source_materials... Let me check P0286's key_findings:\n- \"围ICI期使用抗生素或PPIs\" → \"多项荟萃分析显示与较差的总生存期（OS）和无进展生存期（PFS）相关\"\n- \"皮质类固醇用于姑息治疗 vs. irAE管理\" → \"表现出'指征反转'现象\"\n- \"RAAS抑制剂\" → \"部分回顾性研究显示可能改善OS\"\n- \"当前AI应用状态\" → \"处于早期阶段\"\n\nAnd P0088's key_findings:\n- \"ICI + PPI vs 其他组合\" → \"发现四个SOC存在显著的DDI信号：先天性/家族性/遗传性疾病（RORadj=2.66）、肝胆疾病（RORadj=7.10）、代谢与营养障碍（RORadj=2.66）、皮肤及皮下组织疾病（RORadj=1.53）\"\n\nSo yes, the FAERS data is from P0088, not P0286. The current plan incorrectly attributes FAERS findings to P0286.\n\nNow let me also check: in the current Ch4_U02 supporting_studies, P0286 is listed with contribution about FAERS signals. This needs to be corrected to P0088.\n\nActually, looking more carefully at the current plan's supporting_studies for Ch4_U02:\n- P0339: meta-analysis ✓\n- P0537: chemo timing ✓\n- P0286: \"引用FAERS自发报告系统信号显示ICI+PPI联用显著升高肝胆疾病（RORadj 7.10）...\" - THIS IS WRONG, should be P0088\n- P0289: oral bacteria ✓\n- P0088: \"提供PPI改变乳酸杆菌科和韦荣球菌属相对丰度的微生物组数据\" - Wait, this doesn't match P0088's actual content either!\n\nLet me re-check P0088. P0088 is \"Adverse reactions of immune checkpoint inhibitors combined with Proton pump inhibitors: a pharmacovigilance analysis of drug-drug interactions\". Its key findings are about FAERS DDI signals.\n\nBut in the current plan, P0088 is listed as providing \"PPI改变乳酸杆菌科和韦荣球菌属相对丰度的微生物组数据\". This doesn't match P0088 at all!\n\nLooking at P0537's material: \"PPI使用者乳酸杆菌科和韦荣球菌属相对丰度较高\" - this is from P0537, not P0088!\n\nSo there are multiple citation errors in the current Ch4_U02 plan:\n1. P0286 is incorrectly attributed FAERS findings (should be P0088)\n2. P0088 is incorrectly attributed microbiome composition data (should be P0537)\n\nLet me now plan the corrections:\n\nFor Ch4_U02:\n- Case 3 (FAERS): Change source_handle from P0286 to P0088\n- Supporting study P0286: Change to correctly describe P0286's contribution (iDDI framework, not FAERS)\n- Supporting study P0088: Change to correctly describe P0088's contribution (FAERS DDI signals)\n- The microbiome composition data (Lactobacillaceae, Veillonella) is from P0537, which is already listed\n\nActually, let me re-read the supporting_studies more carefully:\n\nCurrent P0286 entry: \"引用FAERS自发报告系统信号显示ICI+PPI联用显著升高肝胆疾病（RORadj 7.10）、皮肤及代谢障碍的报告率，对比H2B未达显著生存影响的观察，提供临床用药降级与监测建议的实证依据。\"\n→ This should be P0088's contribution\n\nCurrent P0088 entry: \"提供PPI改变乳酸杆菌科和韦荣球菌属相对丰度的微生物组数据，支持PPI诱导特定菌群失调从而干扰免疫稳态的生物学基础。\"\n→ This is actually P0537's finding, not P0088's\n\nSo the corrections needed:\n1. In cases: Change P0286 to P0088 for the FAERS case\n2. In supporting_studies: \n   - P0286 should describe the iDDI framework (its actual contribution)\n   - P0088 should describe the FAERS DDI signals\n   - The microbiome composition data is already covered by P0537\n\nLet me also check if P0289 is correctly used. P0289 is the SCRUM-Japan MONSTAR-SCREEN study. Its key findings include:\n- \"上消化道肿瘤（特别是胃/胰腺癌术后）及PPI使用者粪便中口腔细菌比例显著高于其他人群\"\n- \"粪便中高比例口腔细菌与较短的PFS显著相关\"\n- \"高口腔细菌比例在PPI使用者中与更差的PFS趋势相关\"\n\nIn the current plan, P0289 is listed as: \"描述PPI促进口腔细菌定植、降低α多样性的机制证据，结合P0537构建'胃酸抑制→菌群失调→免疫priming受损'的逻辑链。\"\n\nThis is roughly correct - P0289 does show PPI users have more oral bacteria. Good.\n\nNow, for the paragraph_briefs in Ch4_U02:\n- Paragraph 2 mentions \"P0289/P0088关于PPI促进口腔细菌定植、降低α多样性的描述\" - P0088 doesn't describe this, P0289 does. Should be P0289/P0537.\n- Paragraph 3 mentions \"P0286 FAERS信号\" - should be P0088.\n\nOK, so I need to make these corrections. Let me also think about whether the overall structure needs changes.\n\nThe improvement focus says Ch4 should handle:\n- 时间窗 ✓ (covered in both units)\n- 剂量 ✓ (P0061 >10 days in U01)\n- 药物类别 - partially covered (fluoroquinolones mentioned in U01, H2B vs PPI in U02)\n- 肿瘤背景 ✓ (HCC in U01, cancer type subgroups in U02)\n- 替代用药比较 ✓ (H2B in U02)\n\nAnd:\n- 指示偏倚 - mentioned but could be more explicit\n- 化疗时序修饰 ✓ (P0537 in U02)\n- HCC 阴性结果 ✓ (P0275 in U01)\n- 残余混杂 - mentioned in synthesis\n\nI think the main changes needed are:\n1. Fix citation errors in Ch4_U02 (P0286 vs P0088)\n2. Add P0576/P0402/P0081 to Ch4_U01 for stronger timing evidence\n3. Strengthen indication bias discussion slightly\n4. Keep overall structure as it's well-organized\n\nLet me now write the updated plans.\n\nActually, I need to be careful. The task says \"自主细纲强化模式\" - I should only make changes that provide substantive benefit. Let me assess:\n\n1. The citation errors in Ch4_U02 are factual errors that MUST be corrected.\n2. Adding P0576/P0402 to Ch4_U01 would strengthen the timing evidence but the current plan already has P0575 which is the strongest single study. P0576/P0402 are narrative reviews that summarize the broader literature. Adding them would add breadth but the current plan is already well-supported.\n3. P0081 provides quantitative meta-analytic data for the [-45,45] window which would strengthen U01.\n\nLet me decide: I'll make the citation corrections in U02 (essential), add P0081 to U01's supporting studies (strengthens the quantitative evidence), and add P0576 to U01 (provides the broader timing context). I'll also slightly strengthen the indication bias language.\n\nFor U01, I'll also add P0402 since it's a duplicate of P0576 (same paper, different handle). Actually, looking at the source_identity_map, P0576 has paper_id \"CorpusId:286786239\" and P0402 has paper_id \"affb01ce6dd2c0ea0909edc814fd8af01596e021\". They have different paper_ids but the same title \"THE IMPACT OF ANTIBIOTIC THERAPY ON THE EFFECTIVENESS OF IMMUNOTHERAPY: A REVIEW OF CURRENT EVIDENCE\". These appear to be the same paper with different identifiers. I should use one handle consistently. Looking at the chapter's source_handles list, both P0576 and P0402 are listed. I'll use P0576 since it appears in the directed_reads.\n\nWait, actually looking more carefully, P0576 has doi \"10.31435/ijitss.1(49).2026.4882\" and P0402 also has doi \"10.31435/ijitss.1(49).2026.4882\". They ARE the same paper. The chapter lists both handles. I'll use P0576 as it's in the directed_reads.\n\nNow let me write the final updated plans. I need to be thorough and complete.\n\nFor Ch4_U01, the changes are:\n- Add P0081 and P0576 to supporting_studies\n- Slightly strengthen the ordered_development to mention indication bias more explicitly\n- Keep the paragraph structure but add P0081 to paragraph 1 or 2\n\nFor Ch4_U02, the changes are:\n- Fix Case 3: P0286 → P0088\n- Fix supporting_studies: correct P0286 and P0088 descriptions\n- Fix paragraph_briefs: correct source_handles\n- Keep overall structure\n\nLet me write this out now.",
